id: aura-tail
name: Aura Tail
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCostPerTier: 4
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
# A Special Maneuver, open while Evil Saiyan's Aura Expansion is had. What an Aura Tail does by Saiyan Heritage's Option: the table's.
special: true
source: Core Rule
description: >
  You gain an Aura Tail - its effects by your Saiyan Heritage Option.
text: >
  Aura Tail [1/Round]: Either by coating your tail in energy or creating a phantom tail, you gain the strengths of having a tail with none of the weaknesses.
  –Maneuver Type: Standard Maneuver
  –Action Cost: 1 Action
  –Minions: N/A
  –KP Cost: 4(T)
  –Exploitable: N/A
  –Effect: You gain an Aura Tail. While you have an Aura Tail, depending on your choice for the Option effect of Saiyan Heritage, apply the following effects:
  • Tailed. Your Tail cannot be lost, is temporarily regrown if it was lost, and you ignore the 4th effect of Saiyan Heritage. Additionally, increase your Damage Reduction by 1(T).
  • Tailless. You benefit from both the effects of the Tailless and Tailed options of Saiyan Heritage.
